    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## WhatsApp webhook signature check\n\nSet two environment variables:\n- WHATSAPP_APP_SECRET (Meta app secret)\n- WHATSAPP_VERIFY_TOKEN (the token you type in the Meta webhook setup)\n\nThe Code node uses `crypto`. On self-hosted n8n, allow it with NODE_FUNCTION_ALLOW_BUILTIN=crypto. Env access in nodes must also be allowed.\n\nPut your own logic after 'Your logic here'.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 420
      },
      "id": "n-note",
      "name": "Read me",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
